{"ok":true,"command":"asset","data":{"assets":[{"id":"11277665304834","name":"国风_可进入宫廷建筑","desc":"该建筑为典型的中式传统小型殿宇造型，拥有飞檐翘角的坡屋顶，下方由红柱支撑，坐落在带台阶的石砌台基之上。屋顶覆盖暖橙黄色的筒瓦，搭配朱红色的立柱与棂格门窗，墙面为浅米黄色。整体质感圆润柔和，色彩明快饱满，呈现出Q版卡通化的国风游戏资产风格。","preview":{"url":"https://p9-dy-hamlet-ugc-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-c2ox06qgwk/aigc_editor/036646d8aa72445093df0ed8c9b937e5.png~tplv-c2ox06qgwk-image-256.png?rk3s=649a29f5&x-expires=1797241229&x-signature=bM2aDHniS703cskxRaVGRKtDZSo%3D","uri":"tos-cn-i-c2ox06qgwk/aigc_editor/036646d8aa72445093df0ed8c9b937e5.png"},"resource":{"url":"https://lf26-hamlet-resource-sign.douyincdn.com/hamlet-ugc/aigc_editor/dev/unity/11280829478402.glb?x-expires=1797241229&x-signature=NJa8Q09EfwpQX7n3ULktPjOVnx0%3D","uri":"hamlet-ugc/aigc_editor/dev/unity/11280829478402.glb"},"resourceType":7,"dataType":1,"resourceUrls":[],"style":2,"shapeType":1,"categoryList":[2],"productCategoryList":[100],"module":1,"scale":{"x":7.54011607170105,"y":7.54011607170105,"z":7.54011607170105},"createTime":1793091657,"source":1,"resourceTaskId":"0","isFavorite":false,"capacity":"13320","faceCount":"13120","logicalCenter":{"x":0.00030423196897927385,"y":0,"z":0.0006307718581491928},"rigged":false,"createFrom":"Official","status":"Online","reviewStatus":"Approved","platformStatus":"Online","isPublish":true,"totalUsageCount":"115","totalFavoriteCount":"11"},{"id":"9820400782338","name":"徽派建筑房屋","desc":"该资产由三座错落相连的传统中式坡顶房屋组成，整体为紧凑的合院式布局，造型圆润规整。建筑以白墙搭配深灰筒瓦坡顶，门窗与墙面木饰为暖红棕色，墙基与台阶由浅石色砖石铺成。屋前平台摆放着陶制容器与绿植，整体呈现出Q版柔和的国风卡通设计风格。","preview":{"url":"https://p3-dy-hamlet-ugc-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-c2ox06qgwk/aigc_editor/2474efedb0cc40d88c48c7dd64a2d123.png~tplv-c2ox06qgwk-image-256.png?rk3s=649a29f5&x-expires=1797241229&x-signature=7ExediyU6DzkOzasy0iWEK3Ej3I%3D","uri":"tos-cn-i-c2ox06qgwk/aigc_editor/2474efedb0cc40d88c48c7dd64a2d123.png"},"resource":{"url":"https://lf26-hamlet-resource-sign.douyincdn.com/hamlet-ugc/aigc_editor/dev/unity/9838848093698.glb?x-expires=1797241229&x-signature=0Of47SVs4iyuRGDHVf